{"5359210":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"我姓夏","steam_appid":5359210,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is not a story of heroes. It is a story of family.<\/h2><br>One dusk before 221 BC, a traveling teacher crouched on a river dam and taught a village boy to write a single character: &quot;人&quot; — person.<br><br>2,300 years later, a child sprawls on a desk, tracing the same character with a brush, crooked and ink-stained.<br><br>Between them: sixteen generations.<br><br>Ji, Shu, Zhang, You, Jing, Yan, Mu, Ce, Sheng, Zhou, Yan, Mo, Heng, Zhong, Xie, Lin — sixteen ordinary men, each watching the world change its colors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every chapter, you are the head of the household<\/h2><br>No chosen one, no stat panels. Each generation faces the same things: land, taxes, soldiers, books, marriage, funerals. Your choices are few, but every one of them carries weight — and each chapter ends with a ledger of what this family gained and what it lost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2,300 years, 16 generations — from the Warring States to the Republic era, 32 chapters, two per dynasty, never skipping a beat.<br><\/li><li>211 meaningful choices — no stat grinding, no affection grinding. Choices change people and events, recorded in black and white at the end of every chapter.<br><\/li><li>Three true crossroads — serve or withdraw (Three Kingdoms); sword or brush (Song); loyalty or survival (early Qing). No right answers, only the road you choose for this family.<br><\/li><li>Four invisible ledgers — status, letters, martial skill, bloodline, quietly tracked across centuries until the very last page.<br><\/li><li>Visible proof of survival — in every dynasty something real carries on: a hand-copied scripture, a wooden tablet inscribed on both sides, a sheet of paper full of names. Why China never fell apart is shown, never told.<br><\/li><li>235,000+ characters, hand-drawn ink art — 40 dynasty backdrops, 12 CG scenes, a 12–15 hour first playthrough.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three promises<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No battlefields, no gore — wars happen off-screen. You see the people before, after, and on the road.<br><\/li><li>Historical figures never speak for themselves — they appear, but every word they say is grounded in sources and logic.<br><\/li><li>No slogans at the end — the final frame is always a child.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is this for<\/h2><br>If you finished &quot;1587, A Year of No Significance&quot; and wanted more; if you have played many visual novels and found most of them too light; if you ever wondered why &quot;Huaxia&quot; — this civilization — never scattered the way other ancient civilizations did:<br><br>This game has no answers. It only spreads 2,300 years out on the table, and shows you one surname.<br>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is not a story of heroes. It is a story of family.<\/h2><br>One dusk before 221 BC, a traveling teacher crouched on a river dam and taught a village boy to write a single character: &quot;人&quot; — person.<br><br>2,300 years later, a child sprawls on a desk, tracing the same character with a brush, crooked and ink-stained.<br><br>Between them: sixteen generations.<br><br>Ji, Shu, Zhang, You, Jing, Yan, Mu, Ce, Sheng, Zhou, Yan, Mo, Heng, Zhong, Xie, Lin — sixteen ordinary men, each watching the world change its colors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every chapter, you are the head of the household<\/h2><br>No chosen one, no stat panels. Each generation faces the same things: land, taxes, soldiers, books, marriage, funerals. Your choices are few, but every one of them carries weight — and each chapter ends with a ledger of what this family gained and what it lost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2,300 years, 16 generations — from the Warring States to the Republic era, 32 chapters, two per dynasty, never skipping a beat.<br><\/li><li>211 meaningful choices — no stat grinding, no affection grinding. Choices change people and events, recorded in black and white at the end of every chapter.<br><\/li><li>Three true crossroads — serve or withdraw (Three Kingdoms); sword or brush (Song); loyalty or survival (early Qing). No right answers, only the road you choose for this family.<br><\/li><li>Four invisible ledgers — status, letters, martial skill, bloodline, quietly tracked across centuries until the very last page.<br><\/li><li>Visible proof of survival — in every dynasty something real carries on: a hand-copied scripture, a wooden tablet inscribed on both sides, a sheet of paper full of names. Why China never fell apart is shown, never told.<br><\/li><li>235,000+ characters, hand-drawn ink art — 40 dynasty backdrops, 12 CG scenes, a 12–15 hour first playthrough.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three promises<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No battlefields, no gore — wars happen off-screen. You see the people before, after, and on the road.<br><\/li><li>Historical figures never speak for themselves — they appear, but every word they say is grounded in sources and logic.<br><\/li><li>No slogans at the end — the final frame is always a child.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is this for<\/h2><br>If you finished &quot;1587, A Year of No Significance&quot; and wanted more; if you have played many visual novels and found most of them too light; if you ever wondered why &quot;Huaxia&quot; — this civilization — never scattered the way other ancient civilizations did:<br><br>This game has no answers. It only spreads 2,300 years out on the table, and shows you one surname.<br>","short_description":"Wo Xing Xia (I Am Xia) is a historical interactive fiction spanning 2,300 years. From the late Warring States period to 1949, sixteen generations of one ordinary family write, marry, fight and survive through every dynasty — in hand-drawn ink-line art, with no heroes and no shortcuts.","supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/6824d7acf59f6dcad6ff61bf9d5fc67431f491c1\/header.jpg?t=1793737827","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/ab362509257e67c426fbcbdbe7d3b846f87769f3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793737827","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/ab362509257e67c426fbcbdbe7d3b846f87769f3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793737827","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7 或更高<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 或同级<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> 任意标准声卡<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7 或更高<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 或同级<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> 任意标准声卡<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Summer28"],"publishers":["Summer28"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":599,"final":599,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$5.99"},"packages":[1851238],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy 我姓夏","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1851238,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"我姓夏 - $5.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":599}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/1577a71f7dbfeedf3d5e6d39e6eb80766fb1e406\/ss_1577a71f7dbfeedf3d5e6d39e6eb80766fb1e406.600x338.jpg?t=1793737827","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/1577a71f7dbfeedf3d5e6d39e6eb80766fb1e406\/ss_1577a71f7dbfeedf3d5e6d39e6eb80766fb1e406.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793737827"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/9cb686b147e76e2a8cef6e4b5429d56daabdd9ee\/ss_9cb686b147e76e2a8cef6e4b5429d56daabdd9ee.600x338.jpg?t=1793737827","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/9cb686b147e76e2a8cef6e4b5429d56daabdd9ee\/ss_9cb686b147e76e2a8cef6e4b5429d56daabdd9ee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793737827"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/328356c166357b667611bb25c813fdbee8ac97c9\/ss_328356c166357b667611bb25c813fdbee8ac97c9.600x338.jpg?t=1793737827","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/328356c166357b667611bb25c813fdbee8ac97c9\/ss_328356c166357b667611bb25c813fdbee8ac97c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793737827"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/2bd0f4e37b04819904188c7f9274f20b303edf95\/ss_2bd0f4e37b04819904188c7f9274f20b303edf95.600x338.jpg?t=1793737827","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5359210\/2bd0f4e37b04819904188c7f9274f20b303edf95\/ss_2bd0f4e37b04819904188c7f9274f20b303edf95.1920x10